CORE
contract.sol
--solidity-path-coverage --path-cov-certify cert.json --solidity-max-tx 1 --unwind 1
^ERROR: --path-cov-certify: unit 'sol:@C@C@F@a#22' — REFUSING THE QUERY: this unit is a NAMED OBSTACLE
\(lost decision: no; calls a gated unit: yes\)
\A(?!(.|\n)*^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$)
\A(?!(.|\n)*^VERIFICATION FAILED$)
\A(?!(.|\n)*RESULT: CERTIFIED)
